{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"xinyang-e-892fc84295a3cf1c0f6f","title":"辛毗谏宫室明帝答","accounts":[{"id":"xinyang-a-892fc84295a3cf1c0f6f","label":"正文","text":"辛毗谏宫室明帝答","evidence":["xinyang-q-b22a941660813d75b9c4","xinyang-q-d0ff7f3ca63a10d02fd2"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0203","role":"上疏","evidence":["xinyang-q-b22a941660813d75b9c4","xinyang-q-d0ff7f3ca63a10d02fd2"]},{"person":"wendi-p0005","role":"答疏","evidence":["xinyang-q-b22a941660813d75b9c4","xinyang-q-d0ff7f3ca63a10d02fd2"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"未审定公元年，不从相邻段落推算。","evidence":["xinyang-q-b22a941660813d75b9c4","xinyang-q-d0ff7f3ca63a10d02fd2"]},"ordering_evidence":"xinyang-q-b22a941660813d75b9c4","order":5030}],"persons":[{"id":"wendi-p0005","name":"曹叡","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0203","name":"辛毗","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"xinyang-q-b22a941660813d75b9c4","section":"chapter-025","block":"b-78a882208afcfbc6cef8","layer":"original","quote":"帝方修殿舍，百姓劳役。毗上疏曰：“窃闻诸葛亮讲武治兵，而孙权市马辽东〖12〗；量其意指，似欲相左右〖13〗。备豫不虞〖14〗，古之善政；而今者宫室大兴，加连年谷麦不收。诗云：‘民亦劳止〖15〗，迄可小康〖16〗，惠此中国〖17〗，以绥四方。’唯陛下为社稷计。”","section_title":"辛毗杨阜高堂隆传第二十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0056.xhtml","index":83,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":130},{"id":"xinyang-q-d0ff7f3ca63a10d02fd2","section":"chapter-025","block":"b-8610c211be25fb4357cb","layer":"original","quote":"帝报曰：“二虏未灭而治宫室，直谏者立名之时也。夫王者之都，当及民劳兼办〖18〗；使后世无所复增，是萧何为汉规摹之略也〖19〗。今卿为魏重臣，亦宜解其大归〖20〗。”","section_title":"辛毗杨阜高堂隆传第二十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0056.xhtml","index":84,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":82}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
